      "message": "Then here are some scenarios where AP cannot pet the watchdog:\n1) When inside FW. There are sub-scenarios:\n   * FAFT BIOS tests make the AP to remain in FW for a prolonged duration\n   * In field recovery where the user is preparing a USB stick or doing a network based recovery\n   * In field when the firmware is accidentally corrupted/broken in both slots\n2) In Developer mode the device will take a longer time to boot to OS.\n3) In Developer mode when the user has installed an alternate OS.\n\nWe need AP Hang Detect module to handle these scenarios before enabling this feature.",
